diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index f725bf8..d54db1b 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -130,6 +130,9 @@
 
 ### Bug fixes
 
+- Fixed a bug where inlining could generate invalid code when an inlined
+  parameter was used as an argument in a record update expression.
+
 - Fixed a bug where `echo` could crash on JavaScript if the module contains
   record variants with the same name as some built-in JavaScript objects.
   ([Louis Pilfold](https://github.com/lpil))
